{"id":"n224018877b","headline":"Fusion CX Eyes Major Growth With AI, Prepares For IPO","summary":"Customer experience firm Fusion CX is investing in AI-enabled services and aims to lift the share of AI-related revenue to 25% within 12-18 months. It is preparing an IPO of Rs 800-1,000 crore in October.","why":"Customer experience outsourcing firms are a major part of India's services export sector, and their IPOs give investors access to that market.","category":"companies","event_type":"capital","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"India","country":"India","lat":20.59,"lon":78.96,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Rediff","url":"https://www.rediff.com/business/report/fusion-cx-bets-big-on-ai-services-and-data-infrastructure/20261003.htm"},"sources":[{"name":"Rediff","url":"https://www.rediff.com/business/report/fusion-cx-bets-big-on-ai-services-and-data-infrastructure/20261003.htm"}],"published_at":"2026-10-03T13:41:52Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T08:33:11Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"302cb8e62de6b686","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T08:33:11Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-10-03T13:41:52Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-10-03T18:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"RP","description_from":"publisher page metadata"}}